# Normalize line endings so byte-for-byte invariants (the AGENT_WORKLOG.md
# append-only byte-prefix check and the pnpm-lock.yaml identity guard) do
# not depend on any machine's core.autocrlf or checkout configuration.
# A path attribute set here overrides core.autocrlf for that path.
# A repository-wide `* text=auto eol=lf` is deliberately NOT set: one tracked
# file (src/pages/ai-readable-knowledge-architecture.md) is committed with
# CRLF bytes and `git add --renormalize` would rewrite it; that is a separate
# owner decision. Only paths whose committed bytes are already LF are pinned.
AGENT_WORKLOG.md text eol=lf
pnpm-lock.yaml text eol=lf

# Byte-identity artifacts: never subject to any text conversion.
src/data/public-surface-authority-map/runtime-manifest.json -text
src/data/public-surface-authority-map/last-known-good.json -text
src/data/public-surface-authority-map/runtime-snapshots/*.json -text
src/data/public-surface-adjacency-map/runtime-manifest.json -text
src/data/public-surface-adjacency-map/last-known-good.json -text
src/data/public-surface-adjacency-map/runtime-snapshots/*.json -text
